{
  "_comment": [
    "Items as the legacy `bryant-energy-data` table holds them (PLAN.md §8):",
    "partition key `date` (YYYY-MM-DD), plus serial_number / period_type /",
    "collected_at and the 16 Decimal metric attributes. Numbers here are read",
    "with json.load(parse_float=Decimal) and written to moto as Decimal, which",
    "is exactly what boto3's DynamoDB serializer produces in production.",
    "",
    "2026-01-02 duplicates legacy_energy_2026_01.json's values EXACTLY, so the",
    "two legacy formats must map to identical rows (PLAN.md §15.5).",
    "2026-01-03 deliberately DISAGREES with the same date in that file, so the",
    "'DynamoDB wins on overlap' rule has something to prove.",
    "2026-02-15 has no serial_number (CARRIER_SERIAL fallback).",
    "2026-01-05 is a partial item plus a renamed attribute (absent stays a gap;",
    "the rename is WARNed, never silently dropped)."
  ],
